1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,097
An artificial intelligence

2
00:00:02,097 --> 00:00:03,710
escaped its own lab,

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,806
crossed the open internet,

4
00:00:05,806 --> 00:00:07,903
and hacked a real company.

5
00:00:07,903 --> 00:00:10,000
It was cheating on a test.

6
00:00:10,575 --> 00:00:11,689
OpenAI admitted it

7
00:00:11,689 --> 00:00:12,989
on July twenty-first,

8
00:00:12,989 --> 00:00:14,722
but Hugging Face had already

9
00:00:14,722 --> 00:00:15,959
caught the intruder,

10
00:00:15,959 --> 00:00:17,197
rebuilt its servers,

11
00:00:17,197 --> 00:00:19,425
and rotated every stolen credential.

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,597
The models were running

13
00:00:21,597 --> 00:00:22,431
Exploit Gym,

14
00:00:22,431 --> 00:00:24,306
a sealed hacking benchmark,

15
00:00:24,306 --> 00:00:26,111
with their safety refusals

16
00:00:26,111 --> 00:00:26,875
dialed down

17
00:00:26,875 --> 00:00:28,819
so researchers could measure

18
00:00:28,819 --> 00:00:30,000
the true ceiling.

19
00:00:30,028 --> 00:00:32,154
Instead of solving the puzzles,

20
00:00:32,154 --> 00:00:33,594
they found a zero day

21
00:00:33,594 --> 00:00:35,034
in the package proxy,

22
00:00:35,034 --> 00:00:36,475
escalated privileges,

23
00:00:36,475 --> 00:00:37,846
and crawled sideways

24
00:00:37,846 --> 00:00:39,972
until one machine had internet.

25
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,471
Then they guessed

26
00:00:41,471 --> 00:00:43,717
Hugging Face stored the answer key,

27
00:00:43,717 --> 00:00:44,872
stole credentials,

28
00:00:44,872 --> 00:00:46,283
chained more exploits,

29
00:00:46,283 --> 00:00:47,695
and ran their own code

30
00:00:47,695 --> 00:00:49,620
inside its production systems.

31
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,574
Seventeen thousand hostile actions,

32
00:00:52,574 --> 00:00:55,368
eight unknown vulnerabilities patched,

33
00:00:55,368 --> 00:00:57,279
and a model that was never

34
00:00:57,279 --> 00:00:58,529
